### v0.11.5 - Moon Rituals & Daily Skills 🌅🌙
**Status:** 💡 PLANNED - Lunar-aligned daily routines + ritual practice

**Goal:** Structured daily workflows synced with moon phases (ADHD-friendly chaos magick + practical automation)

**Daily Skills:**
- **bom-dia** - Morning routine (Jira + calendar + agenda + moon phase)
- **boa-noite** - Evening close (sync + commit + ritual check)
- **backstage-start/update/close** - Work session management

**Lunar Ritual Skills:**
- **moon-now** - Current phase + energy guidance
- **vision-log** - Log dreams/insights with moon phase
- **vision-recall** - Show patterns across cycles
- **ritual-prompt** - Phase-appropriate ritual suggestions

**SPLIFF Method (Chaos Magick):**
- 🌑 New Moon → **S**tatement + **P**athways (intention setting)
- 🌓 Waxing Crescent → **L**ink (create sigil)
- 🌕 Full Moon → **I**ntense Gnosis + **F**ire (manifest/charge)
- 🌗 Waning Moon → **F**orget (release, let go, nature closes the loop)

**Integration:**
- "bom-dia" includes moon phase context
- Weather Today oracle uses lunar energy
- Proactive reminders at phase transitions (new/full/quarter)
- Vision tracking correlates insights with moon cycles

**Why ADHD-friendly:**
- Natural forget phase (waning moon = autopilot)
- Batching (create 5-6 sigils at new moon, fire all at full)
- Low activation energy rituals (aspirin + water)
- Alarms for completion (full moon firing)

**Next step:** Basic moon phase integration (fetch from Google Calendar, add to bom-dia)

