**What Pi-hole provides:**
- Network-wide ad blocking (all devices benefit)
- DNS-level tracking prevention
- Custom DNS rules (block specific domains)
- Network usage stats (which devices/domains active)
- Faster browsing (blocks before loading)

**Use cases:**
- Block ads on iPhone/iPad (no per-device config needed)
- Protect all home devices (smart TV, IoT, etc.)
- Privacy: block trackers/telemetry
- Parental controls (block categories of sites)

